  <!--EN: Tier 0-->
  <VVE_Tier0>0 级</VVE_Tier0>
  <!--EN: Tier 0 vehicles are the most basic and easiest to access. They don't require resources to be constructed, or research project to be researched, or neither.-->
  <VVE_Tier0Desc>0 级车辆是最基本且最容易访问的车辆。它们不需要建造资源，也不需要研究项目，或者两者都不需要。</VVE_Tier0Desc>
  <!--EN: Tier 1-->
  <VVE_Tier1>1 级</VVE_Tier1>
  <!--EN: Tier 1 vehicles require a basic research project and a low resource cost in order to be constructed. They are inefficient, not ideal, have a lot of drawbacks, but they are cheap and available early in the game.-->
  <VVE_Tier1Desc>一级车辆的建造需要基础研究项目和较低的资源成本。它们效率低下，不理想，有很多缺点，但它们很便宜并且可以在游戏早期使用。</VVE_Tier1Desc>
  <!--EN: Tier 2-->
  <VVE_Tier2>2 级</VVE_Tier2>
  <!--EN: Tier 2 vehicles are locked behind more specialised research projects and require resources that are only available later in the game. Tier 2 is considered to be the 'baseline' of all vehicles.-->
  <VVE_Tier2Desc>2 级车辆被锁定在更专业的研究项目后面，并且需要只能在游戏后期才能获得的资源。第 2 级被认为是所有车辆的“基线”。</VVE_Tier2Desc>
  <!--EN: Tier 3-->
  <VVE_Tier3>3 级</VVE_Tier3>
  <!--EN: Tier 3 vehicles are only obtainable if a specific condition is met - for example, they are first found in their wrecked form and restored. They require late game resources and generally serve a very specific purpose.-->
  <VVE_Tier3Desc>只有满足特定条件才能获得 3 级车辆 - 例如，它们首先以失事形式被发现并修复。它们需要后期游戏资源并且通常具有非常特定的目的。</VVE_Tier3Desc>
  <!--EN: Tier 3-->
  <VVE_Tier4>3 级</VVE_Tier4>
  <!--EN: Tier 4 vehicles are not able to be constructed by the player, but they can still be found, purchased or otherwise spawned. They generally represent technology beyond of what's achievable in the Rimworld setting.-->
  <VVE_Tier4Desc>玩家无法建造 4 级车辆，但仍然可以找到、购买或以其他方式生成它们。它们通常代表着超出环世界设定所能实现的技术。</VVE_Tier4Desc>
  <!--EN: Vehicle is blocking garage.-->
  <VVE_VehicleObstructingClosingGarage>车辆堵塞车库。</VVE_VehicleObstructingClosingGarage>
  <!--EN: Tier-->
  <VVE_VehicleTier>等级</VVE_VehicleTier>
